  "implemented": [
    "Internal immutable private GPU randomness selection imports all four independent protocol streams: input salts, FRI salts, witness hiding/randomization and quotient samples/masks",
    "Explicit construction snapshots preserve CPU cursor semantics; active PCS clones share cursors and a common failure state; selected streams reject host expansion",
    "Main/base and cubic lookup hiding, standalone randomization, quotient masks, input commitment salts and FRI salts consume private device samples without sample uploads/readbacks",
    "Complete retained-output/sampling admission precedes draws; full-proof and stage guards retire every selected stream on execution failure or unwind",
    "Trusted public preprocessing salts remain a separate reusable setup capability and configuration"
  ],
  "runtime_selection": "Internal test/configuration API only; no environment activation or registered runtime GPU randomness selection",
